{
  "name": "mcp-protocol-edges",
  "description": "JSON-RPC edge cases on an in-process MCP server: requests before initialize, an integer or unknown protocolVersion, string ids, unknown and unserved methods, a notification sent as a request, malformed tools/call and tools/list parameters, a stray notification and response, and _meta on a call.",
